  "description": "Give your designs a timeless Americana feel with Texas Machine, a bold vintage typewriter-inspired serif font that combines classic Western character with an authentic old-school printing aesthetic. Its strong slab-like serifs, mechanical letterforms, and slightly rugged appearance create a distinctive retro personality while remaining highly readable.\nPerfect for creating vintage logos, Western branding, retro posters, apparel designs, badges, labels, packaging, signage, quotes, invitations, and typography-based artwork.",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Give your designs a timeless Americana feel with Texas Machine, a bold vintage typewriter-inspired serif font that combines classic Western character with an authentic old-school printing aesthetic. Its strong slab-like serifs, mechanical letterforms, and slightly rugged appearance create a distinctive retro personality while remaining highly readable.</p>\n<p>Perfect for creating vintage logos, Western branding, retro posters, apparel designs, badges, labels, packaging, signage, quotes, invitations, and typography-based artwork.</p>",
